{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Controlling the Story", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Preparing Staff for Polygon's Crisis", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 5, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 9, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Identify and describe rules and obligations through a wider range of language and expressions in both work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn8le09ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Simple Past and Present Perfect", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When providing background information, we are usually referring to facts or events that are situated in the past. The <span class=\"italic\">Simple Past Tense</span> is used to simply state these events or situations. When we want to mention these events in light of consequences that are experienced now, we use the <span class=\"italic\">Present Perfect Tense. </span>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The <span class=\"italic\">Present Perfect Tense</span> is formed with the present tense of 'to have' + the <span class=\"italic\">Simple Past</span> form of the main verb (the <span class=\"italic\">Past Participle</span>).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Event - Simple Past</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Consequence of Event - Present Perfect</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"There was a lot of rain last week ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"... so the garden has grown well.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We had a difficult deadline today ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"... and we have met it.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"They experienced so much stress ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"... that they have become very anxious.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "The consequence may begin the sentence as well.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Consequence - Present Perfect</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Event - Simple Past</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We have managed to reduce ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"... the debt we built last year.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"People have responded ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"... because he asked for help.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He has been discouraged ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"... by the poor report he received.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "We had a situation in the office last week that was distressing.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The distressing situation we experienced (event: simple past)  has left us uneasy.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Because of what happened, many workers have thought of quitting.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "I Can Plan a Strategy to Solve a Problem", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Planning and developing strategies to carry out plans is a big part of successful business activity. As we plan our next steps we use the future tense. We use words that express intentions and other expressions that encourage people to come on board with our ideas.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"underline\">Examples of Plans:</span><ul><span class=\"italic\"><li><span class=\"underline\">I will approach</span> our client with some figures.<li><span class=\"underline\">We will ensure</span> that every document is perfect.<li><span class=\"underline\">We will face</span> this crisis with optimism.<li><span class=\"underline\">We will certainly manage</span> finances if we keep careful records of our inventory.<li><span class=\"underline\">I'll try to keep</span> our profile low for now.</span></span><ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"underline\">Examples that encourage people to join the plan:</span> <ul><span class=\"italic\"> <li><span class=\"underline\">Let's</span> make sure we keep each other informed. <li><span class=\"underline\">Please be encouraged by</span> this small progress. <li><span class=\"underline\">Please be careful to</span> keep this news quiet. <li><span class=\"underline\">We will</span> reach our goals <span class=\"underline\">if we</span> keep focused.</span></ul>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "wearying ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "tiring", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  Going through treatment can be a wearying stage.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le09ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when training for crisis management.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "discouraging ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "causing less hope", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Developing strategies for recovery can take long and be discouraging. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le09ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "fully informed", "type": "name"}, {"content": "having all the necessary  knowledge about a situation", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  Farmani has probably not been fully informed of the situation.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le09ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "disheartening ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "causing less enthusiasm or emotional energy ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Recently, Polygon faced a disheartening crisis.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le09ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "committed ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "completely dedicated to something ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We have decided to take action, but we need everyone's committed support.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le09ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "situation ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a position or location with a set of things happening", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Farmani has probably not been fully informed of the situation. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le09ob05aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to outsource", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to send part of a company's work outside the country ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: In short, we have discovered that the factory where Holly's outsources its labor employs young children.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le09ob05aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "ethical position", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a decision you make about what is right and wrong in a certain situation", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Please be encouraged by Polygon's ethical position.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le09ob05aud10", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "ability", "type": "name"}, {"content": "how much or well you can do something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Please be encouraged by Polygon's ability to overcome this challenge.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le09ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Imagine that you have a business that is in the final stages of working through a problem.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write down the events that have happened.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Now write down the steps that you and staff have done so far.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Now plan what everyone needs to do to work out the rest of the problem.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write these last steps using requests and instructions of encouragement.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your situation and plan aloud to your partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I review problem solving steps which have been taken.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I plan which problem solving steps still need doing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I make requests and encouraging instructions to colleagues.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my strategy to a partner.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about jobs and work.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can plan a strategy to solve a problem.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can present background information.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "How do you think people feel when the workplace has a crisis?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What do you think is the most difficult stage of a cr