, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn8le09ob05re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Miranda:</span> Great ideas everyone. Yes, stage four, going through treatment, can be a wearying stage. Developing strategies for recovery can take long and be discouraging. But growth happens with recovery. The fifth stage is a time of learning and re-evaluation so that it is possible to prepare for and avoid future challenges. And so the cycle goes.", "id": 1, "time": "00100", "image": "engenn8le09ob05re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "Recently, Polygon faced a disheartening crisis. The crisis seriously affected the economy, but we stopped it with a solution shortly after detection. And we learned that we have a strong staff that works together. Now we are  facing a new challenge which may take longer. We have diagnosed the problem and developed strategies. We have decided to take action, but we need everyone's committed support as we continue.", "id": 2, "time": "25100", "image": "engenn8le09ob05re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "In short, we have discovered that the factory where Holly's outsources its labor employs young children. This is an extremely poor community that we would like to help, but not by employing children. Farmani has probably not been fully informed of the situation. We will approach him and try to find solutions together. However, since the discovery came through social media, the situation will probably become very public. We will make sure you are informed. Please be encouraged by Polygon's ethical position and ability to overcome this challenge. Let's face this problem as an opportunity to learn and grow. We will overcome if we keep up our hope and work together.", "id": 3, "time": "53000", "image": "engenn8le09ob05re2img07.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn8le09ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le09ob05re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}